{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And your offspring who are born after them.</b> These are the children of your sons, who are truly called your offspring." "<b>They shall be yours.</b> They shall be called the house of Joseph and shall be blessed with your blessings." "<b>After the name of their brothers they shall be called in their inheritance.</b> Each one of the sons of Manasseh shall be called after his brothers, by the name of Manasseh, to inherit with them in his inheritance; and likewise each one of the sons of Ephraim shall be called after his brothers, by the name of Ephraim, to inherit with them in the inheritance of Ephraim."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:35:03.850823504Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}